notes.body:
@guyharris 
- I changed the naming in wiretap. I hope adding AUTOSAR to the name - while technically not 100% correct - avoids the name issue in wiretap.
- I left the nameing in epan as is. The naming has been like this for some years and users got used to it. Since I see no issue with the naming there, a breaking change without need seems a bit harsh, don't you agree?

